OL,3,GNEWSA'Honour #120m pledge' pottery boss
OL,4,Atells PM
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe boss of a pottery firm has urged
OL,7,Fthe government to honour its promise of
OL,8,Fa #120m support package ahead of the
OL,9,FAutumn Budget later.
OL,11,F"We need to see action from the
OL,12,Fgovernment," said Michael Scheepers,
OL,13,Fchief executive of Stoke-on-Trent-based
OL,14,FPortmeirion Group. The government
OL,15,Ffunding, including #60m to help
OL,16,Fmanufacturers invest in new equipment,
OL,17,Fwas announced in May.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
