OL,3,GNEWSA'Honour #120m pledge' pottery boss
OL,4,Atells PM
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe welcomed recent meetings with the
OL,7,FDepartment for Business, Innovation,
OL,8,FScience and Trade (DBIST), but added:
OL,9,F"We don't understand yet what exactly
OL,10,Fthe shape of the scheme will be ` who's
OL,11,Fincluded, who's excluded and how it
OL,12,Fwill work."
OL,14,FThe BBC has contacted the DBIST for
OL,15,Fcomment.
